{
  "esm": "2.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mms_bump",
    "description": "Exact section moments of the manufactured solution shared by the MMS problems of grids/sectional_volume_1d -- a fixture template library (grids/*/mesh/ holds fixture data, schema-validated only), so the closed-form moments are written once instead of once per ic equation and test reference. The solution is the compactly supported C2 bump n0(u) = 64 s^3 (1-s)^3, s = clamp((u - ctr)/0.3, 0, 1), centred per spatial cell at ctr = 0.9 + 0.3 c (cell 1 on [1.2, 1.5], cell 2 on [1.5, 1.8]), carried by the growth law G(v) = sigma v with sigma = 3 - 2 c (cell 1 grows, cell 2 shrinks, lam0 = 1). Along characteristics v = u e^{sigma t}, so n(v, t) = e n0(v e) with e = e^{-sigma t}; the moments of section j = [2^((j-1)/NBIN), 2^(j/NBIN)] (the mms_sections_vb grid) are N = P(s(b)) - P(s(a)) and V = e^{-1} [Q(s(b)) - Q(s(a))], a and b the section edges pulled back to t = 0 (edge times e), where P(s) = 64 w [s^4/4 - 3 s^5/5 + s^6/2 - s^7/7] is the antiderivative of n0 (w = 0.3) and Q(s) = ctr P(s) + 64 w^2 [s^5/5 - s^6/2 + 3 s^7/7 - s^8/8] that of u n0(u), both in Horner form. Every template is CLOSED -- it reads only its parameters, literals and the metaparameter NBIN, never a model variable -- so, unlike a free-name geometry template, it may be applied in an ic equation, where the build inlines it like any other template. It may NOT be applied in an esm-spec 6.6.5 test reference: the inline-test oracle evaluates references without resolving template references (EarthSciAST 84ed0627e), so the problems spell the reference moments inline in the same Horner form. `c`, `j` are the cell and section indices and `t` the time.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:mesh-data",
      "family:sectional",
      "grid:sectional_volume_1d",
      "mms"
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mms_bump_s": {
      "params": [
        "u",
        "c"
      ],
      "description": "Bump coordinate of pulled-back volume u in cell c, clamped to the support: s = min(max((u - (0.9 + 0.3 c))/0.3, 0), 1).",
      "body": {
        "op": "min",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "u",
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          0.9,
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              0.3,
                              "c"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  0.3
                ]
              },
              0
            ]
          },
          1
        ]
      }
    },
    "mms_bump_P": {
      "params": [
        "s"
      ],
      "description": "Antiderivative of the number density in the bump coordinate, P(s) = 19.2 s^4 (1/4 + s (-3/5 + s (1/2 - s/7))) (19.2 = 64 w, w = 0.3).",
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          19.2,
          {
            "op": "^",
            "args": [
              "s",
              4
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              0.25,
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "s",
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      -0.6,
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          "s",
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              0.5,
                              {
                                "op": "/",
                                "args": [
                                  "s",
                                  7
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "mms_bump_Q": {
      "params": [
        "s",
        "c"
      ],
      "description": "Antiderivative of the volume density u n0(u) in the bump coordinate for cell c, Q(s) = (0.9 + 0.3 c) P(s) + 5.76 s^5 (1/5 + s (-1/2 + s (3/7 - s/8))) (5.76 = 64 w^2).",
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  0.9,
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      0.3,
                      "c"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "mms_bump_P",
                "bindings": {
                  "s": "s"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              5.76,
              {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  "s",
                  5
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  0.2,
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "s",
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          -0.5,
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              "s",
                              {
                                "op": "-",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "/",
                                    "args": [
                                      3,
                                      7
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "op": "/",
                                    "args": [
                                      "s",
                                      8
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "mms_bump_edge_s": {
      "params": [
        "kn",
        "c",
        "t"
      ],
      "description": "Bump coordinate of the geometric test grid's section edge at volume 2^(kn/NBIN) (bin_nodes index kn + 1, kn = 0..NBIN) at time t in cell c, the edge pulled back along its characteristic: mms_bump_s(2^(kn/NBIN) e^{-(3 - 2 c) t}, c).",
      "body": {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "mms_bump_s",
        "bindings": {
          "u": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                  2,
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "kn",
                      "NBIN"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "exp",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      -1,
                      "t",
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          3,
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              2,
                              "c"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "c": "c"
        }
      }
    },
    "mms_bump_number": {
      "params": [
        "c",
        "j",
        "t"
      ],
      "description": "Exact number moment of section j in cell c at time t: P(s(b)) - P(s(a)).",
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "mms_bump_P",
            "bindings": {
              "s": {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "mms_bump_edge_s",
                "bindings": {
                  "kn": "j",
                  "c": "c",
                  "t": "t"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "mms_bump_P",
            "bindings": {
              "s": {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "mms_bump_edge_s",
                "bindings": {
                  "kn": {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      "j",
                      1
                    ]
                  },
                  "c": "c",
                  "t": "t"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "mms_bump_volume": {
      "params": [
        "c",
        "j",
        "t"
      ],
      "description": "Exact volume moment of section j in cell c at time t: e^{(3 - 2 c) t} [Q(s(b)) - Q(s(a))].",
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "exp",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "t",
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      3,
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          2,
                          "c"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "mms_bump_Q",
                "bindings": {
                  "s": {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "mms_bump_edge_s",
                    "bindings": {
                      "kn": "j",
                      "c": "c",
                      "t": "t"
                    }
                  },
                  "c": "c"
                }
              },
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "mms_bump_Q",
                "bindings": {
                  "s": {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "mms_bump_edge_s",
                    "bindings": {
                      "kn": {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          "j",
                          1
                        ]
                      },
                      "c": "c",
                      "t": "t"
                    }
                  },
                  "c": "c"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
